#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
#: addon/globalPlugins/accesifyPlay/__init__.py:73
#: addon/globalPlugins/accesifyPlay/dialogs/settings.py:21 buildVars.py:21
msgid "Accessify Play"
msgstr "Accessify Play"

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information
#. from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid ""
"Accessify Play provides comprehensive NVDA control for Spotify playback on "
"any Connect-enabled device. A Spotify Premium subscription is required for "
"full functionality."
msgstr ""
"Accessify Play memberikan kontrol NVDA komprehensif untuk pemutaran Spotify "
"di perangkat apa pun yang mendukung Spotify Connect. Langganan Spotify "
"Premium diperlukan untuk fungsionalitas penuh."

#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the
#. add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid ""
"\n"
"- 1.12.1: a smaller download; the 1.12.0 package accidentally contained "
"compiled files.\n"
"- Updates now come from the NVDA Add-on Store; the built-in updater has been"
" removed.\n"
"- Settings, Copy Universal Link and Sleep Timer can now be given a shortcut "
"in Input Gestures.\n"
"- Announce track (I) names the track and says it is paused, instead of "
"\"Nothing is currently playing\".\n"
"- Top Items updates as soon as you change Show or Time Range.\n"
"- Set Volume starts at the current volume; Alt+F in Search follows or "
"unfollows an artist.\n"
"- The sleep timer tells you when it pauses the music.\n"
"- Fixed Help opening an outdated guide, and the lyrics window failing the "
"second time for the same song.\n"
"- Show Lyrics, Go to Album and Go to Artist in album and playlist track "
"lists.\n"
"- Names for unlabeled controls in Search, Devices, Queue, episode, chapter "
"and other lists.\n"
"- Complete and corrected Indonesian translation, and a rewritten user guide."
"\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"- 1.12.1: unduhan lebih kecil; paket 1.12.0 tidak sengaja berisi file "
"terkompilasi.\n"
"- Pembaruan kini datang dari Add-on Store NVDA; pembaru bawaan telah "
"dihapus.\n"
"- Settings, Copy Universal Link, dan Sleep Timer kini bisa diberi pintasan "
"di Input Gestures.\n"
"- Umumkan trek (I) menyebut nama trek dan memberi tahu jika sedang dijeda, "
"bukan \"Tidak ada yang sedang diputar\".\n"
"- Top Items langsung diperbarui saat Show atau Time Range diubah.\n"
"- Atur Volume dimulai dari volume saat ini; Alt+F di Pencarian mengikuti "
"atau berhenti mengikuti artis.\n"
"- Pengatur waktu tidur memberi tahu saat menjeda musik.\n"
"- Memperbaiki Bantuan yang membuka panduan lama, dan jendela lirik yang "
"gagal saat dibuka kedua kali untuk lagu yang sama.\n"
"- Tampilkan Lirik, Buka Album, dan Buka Artis di daftar trek album dan "
"daftar putar.\n"
"- Nama untuk kontrol tanpa label di Pencarian, Perangkat, Antrean, daftar "
"episode, bab, dan lainnya.\n"
"- Terjemahan bahasa Indonesia yang lengkap dan diperbaiki, serta panduan "
"pengguna yang ditulis ulang.\n"
"\t"

